    "final": "Lowest buyable XS price for the Wexcombe tee: $12.61 (Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Tee, Short Sleeve - Dovercourt Apparel, URL http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-09.html). I opened all 45 tee listings in the search results (36 on page 1, 9 on page 2) and checked the Size option, the XS price (read after selecting XS on the page), stock, and Add-to-Cart state on each. 28 listings could actually be bought in size XS; the other 17 either had no XS option at all or the XS option was disabled/sold out, so they were excluded. Several listings showed a misleading 'Promo $X' label next to XS in the dropdown, but the actual price displayed on the page (confirmed against the per-variant price data) was higher, so those labels were disregarded. The complete set of buyable XS prices: Dovercourt $12.61 (lowest), Haldane $14.11, Kettering $14.25, Marchmont $14.54, Dalston $14.67, Oakfield $15.40, Northwick $15.86, Fairhaven $17.51, Ingleton $18.96, Alderney $19.32, Yarrow $20.31, Dunmore $20.33, Westmere $23.17, Gisburn $24.38, Quarles $24.58, Larkspur $26.10, Grantley $29.61, Thirsk $32.30, Elmsworth $32.95, Stonebridge $33.25, Kelsall $33.99, Crowhurst-free list continues: Verity $35.84, Ashgrove $35.70, Foxcombe $36.37, Jarrow $37.77, Fordwich $39.73, Abbotsley $39.82, Marlow $43.39.",
